# 统一换行符：Windows 本地开发、macOS 打包、Linux CI 三端一致，
# 避免 CI 中的 bash 脚本因 CRLF 失效
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件不做行尾转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.node binary
*.sqlite binary
*.db binary
